---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PolicyContact from "../../components/PolicyContact.astro";
import { brand } from "../../../brand.config";
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping & Tax">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="page-shell__inner">
      <h1>Shipping &amp; Tax</h1>
      <p>
        At {brand.siteUrl} ("We", "Site"), we are committed to ensuring your
        wholesale children's watch orders are delivered in a timely and efficient
        manner. This policy outlines our shipping processes, tax practices, and
        specific customs requirements for certain regions.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <h2>Stock preparation</h2>
      <p>
        For orders with multiple models and colors, please allow 1–5 business days
        for stock preparation. Orders placed on weekends or holidays will be
        processed the next business day. For security purposes, initial orders or
        those with alternate shipping addresses may require additional verification
        time.
      </p>

      <h2>Shipping options &amp; charges</h2>
      <p>
        We offer free shipping to most countries on qualifying wholesale orders.
        For specific regions requiring a shipping fee, or when you choose express
        or freight-forwarder delivery, the amount will be calculated and clearly
        confirmed in your quote or order form before checkout.
      </p>

      <h2>Order tracking</h2>
      <p>Stay informed about your delivery every step of the way:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Online tracking:</strong> Once shipped, we will provide a tracking
          number for online lookup.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>WhatsApp notifications:</strong> For your convenience, tracking
          details and order updates will be sent to you via WhatsApp.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email updates:</strong> You will receive status updates and estimated
          delivery dates via email.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Special customs requirements (India, Brazil, etc.)</h2>
      <p>
        Certain countries require buyers to submit personal customs clearance
        information in advance. Our team or local partners will contact you if
        additional documents are needed for your destination.
      </p>

      <h2>For India customers (KYC requirements)</h2>
      <p>
        To ensure smooth customs clearance, Indian regulations require KYC (Know
        Your Customer) documents.
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Required documents</strong><br />
          Please provide a clear copy of one of the following:
          <ul>
            <li>Aadhaar Card, Voter ID, or Passport.</li>
          </ul>
          Note: Documents must show both the front (photo and date of birth) and
          back (detailed address).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Submission process</strong><br />
          Our local partners may contact you via WhatsApp, phone, or email. Please
          send your tracking number and the KYC images to{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${brand.supportEmail}`}>{brand.supportEmail}</a>.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Taxes &amp; duties</h2>
      <p>
        Import duties, VAT, GST, and other local taxes are calculated based on the
        destination country's regulations. These charges may be included at checkout
        or confirmed in your order quote, depending on the service selected.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Invoices:</strong> If you require a formal invoice, please leave a
          note during payment or contact us via email at{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${brand.supportEmail}`}>{brand.supportEmail}</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Delivery issues</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter any issues with your delivery, please contact us
        immediately. We will coordinate with our carriers to resolve the matter as
        quickly as possible.
      </p>

      <h2>Title and risk of loss</h2>
      <p>
        All items purchased are made pursuant to a shipment contract. The risk of
        loss and title for such items pass to you upon our delivery of the goods to
        the carrier.
      </p>

      <PolicyContact />

      <p class="policy-related">
        Related: <a href="/policies/refund-policy">Refund policy</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
